<title>GREECE: TSOVOLAS SAYS NO TO NEW TAX ON STATE DEBT PAPER.</title>
<headline>TSOVOLAS SAYS NO TO NEW TAX ON STATE DEBT PAPER.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>The president of the Greek socialist splinter party DIKKI, Dimitris Tsovolas, favours a gradual reduction in interest rates on state securities rather than imposing a tax on them, the party said in a statement. --Dimitris Kontogiannis, Athens Newsroom +301 3311812-4</p>
</text>
